      "text": "不不，像它那样１００％未来的家伙\\n在外面的话，会是个大问题……\\c\\n是弗图博士在管理的？\\n不是吗？他在搞什么？[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
